he \u201cgirl\u201d is something else entirely. She is a <i>Doggy</i>, an artificial human with beastlike ears to mark her as non-human. She has flesh, bones, and blood\u2014but she is far stronger and far more intelligent than any ordinary person.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work with her to search for and jettison any unnecessary items. Then compensate for the excess weight caused by bringing her aboard\u2014a weight that is, well, a little more than it seems... quite a bit more, actually. Uh, how to put it... it\u2019s, you know, really heavy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And finally, prove that the universe hasn\u2019t gone completely cold. Not yet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now then, pilot\u2014it's your turn.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Cold Bed on Route&quot; is an equation-like adventure game. Work with to find and dump unwanted items. Then, let's make up for the excess weight caused by having her on board. And let's prove that the universe is not yet completely cold and frigid. Now, pilot, it's your turn.",
